sequenceDiagram
    participant Runner as discussion-runner.ts
    participant TBM as TokenBudgetManager
    participant builder as buildCombinedPrompt
    participant TE as TokenEstimator
    participant LLM as LLM API
    participant TT as TokenTracker

    Note over Runner: ★ 新架构：一次调用完成发言+记忆更新 ★

    Note over Runner: 角色发言循环（每角色每轮）
    Note over Runner: TokenTracker 已在此会话中初始化

    Runner->>builder: buildCombinedPrompt(rt, ch, round, all)
    activate builder
    Note over builder: 使用 CHAR_SPEECH_COMBINED PromptType<br/>创建 TokenBudgetManager（预算 5000）
    Note over builder: 组装上下文同 buildCharSpeech<br/>末尾附加 JSON 输出格式要求
    builder-->>Runner: combinedPrompt
    deactivate builder

    Note over Runner: 估算输入 token
    Runner->>TE: estimateTokens(sys + combinedPrompt)
    TE-->>Runner: inputTokens

    Runner->>LLM: callProviderLLM(sys, combinedPrompt, ..., onChunk)
    Note over LLM: 流式输出 JSON 字符
    Note over LLM: { "public": { "speech": "..."
    LLM-->>Runner: { content: completeJSON }

    Note over Runner: 估算输出 token
    Runner->>TE: estimateTokens(outputContent)
    TE-->>Runner: outputTokens

    Note over Runner: 记录 token 用量
    Runner->>TT: addRecord({ ch.id, round, "CHAR_SPEECH_COMBINED", inputTokens, outputTokens })

    Note over Runner: IPC → 渲染进程
    Runner->>Runner: send('discuss:token-update', { records })

    Note over Runner: 解析完整 JSON
    Runner->>Runner: parseCharacterOutput(content)

    alt 解析成功
        Note over Runner: extract public.speech → buildMsg + push
        Note over Runner: extract private.memoryUpdate → mergeMemoryUpdate
    else 解析失败
        Note over Runner: fallback: 用全部文本做发言
        Note over Runner: 跳过本轮记忆更新，记 warn 日志
    end

    Note over Runner: *** 单次 LLM 调用完成 ***
